.Dd November 23, 2026
.Dt MDLS 1
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm mdls
.Nd list a file's metadata attributes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl name Ar attribute ...
.Op Fl raw Op Fl nullMarker Ar marker
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
lists the metadata attributes of each
.Ar file ,
each name and its value, the names in order: its name, kind, content
type and the types it conforms to, sizes, dates, owner, and for an
application its bundle identifier, version and copyright.
The attributes are read from the file and its type; there is no index.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl name Ar attribute
Only that attribute (the option may be repeated); one the file does not
have shows
.Dq (null) .
.It Fl raw
The values alone, in the order asked for, separated by NUL characters,
for
.Xr xargs 1
.Fl 0 .
.It Fl nullMarker Ar marker
What a missing value shows with
.Fl raw .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0, or 1 when a file cannot be found.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mdfind 1 ,
.Xr mdutil 1
